---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Principles from '../components/Principles.astro';
import Disclosure from '../components/Disclosure.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<Base title="About" description="EigenCodeAI is a content studio that makes content with AI tools and human direction.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h1>A studio built on AI and good judgement.</h1>
      <p class="lede">{site.legalName} is a content studio. We make music, videos, short series, websites, apps and social media content, for clients and for ourselves.</p>
      <p>The work is made by a team of AI agents we build ourselves, and directed by a team of people who sign off on every piece before it goes out. Agents draft. People approve.</p>
      <p>We're starting a YouTube channel where our hosts, Eigen and Kai, show how the studio runs.</p>
      <p>Alongside client work, we make content for learning and content just for fun. That's where we try new ideas first.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow">The name</p>
      <h2>Why “Eigen”?</h2>
      <p>In maths, an eigenvector is a direction that holds steady when everything else is being transformed. That's how we think about AI: the tools change every week, and our direction doesn't.</p>
      <figure class="eigen">
        <img src="/cast/eigen-three-states.jpg" alt="Eigen in three states: resting with steady rays, excited with rays swirling, and moving on two stubby legs" width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy" />
        <figcaption>It's also the name of our co-host. Eigen's rays are its eigenvectors: steady at rest, swirling when it's excited. <a href="/team#eigen">Meet Eigen and the team</a>.</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <Disclosure />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">How we work</p>
      <h2>Made with AI. Owned by people.</h2>
      <Principles />
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .narrow { max-width: 760px; }
  .eigen { margin: 2rem 0 0; }
  .eigen img { width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: var(--radius); border: 1px solid var(--line); }
  figcaption { font-size: .95rem; color: var(--silver); margin-top: .8rem; }
</style>
